@startuml
title Search and filter the catalog
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Visitor" as V
participant "Web App" as W
participant "Express API" as A
participant "Supabase" as S

V -> W: Enter query + filters (q, category, tag, publisher, sort)
W -> A: GET /api/templates?q=...&category=...&tag=...&publisher=...
A -> S: fetchTaxonomy()
S --> A: taxonomy
A -> S: select template_id from template_tags where tag_id = ?
S --> A: tagged template IDs
A -> S: listPublished({ q, categoryId, publisherId, templateIds, sort })
S --> A: matching rows + total
A --> W: 200 paged results
W --> V: Render filtered results
note over A: An unknown taxonomy slug resolves to an empty page, not an error.
@enduml
